From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:08:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Scrape anime and streaming dumps: title from folders, fansub
 and polish markers

Files carrying only numbers (Frieren/S01E05.mkv, Frieren/Sezon 2/Odcinek
05.mp4, Frieren/05.mkv) were searched as movies named after the number.
A new FolderEpisodeMatcher, run after the TV show matchers and before
the movie ones, takes the show title from the folders (skipping season
folders, reading the season from them or from 'S2'/'2nd Season' in the
show folder) and understands fansub 'Title - 05 [1080p]' names and the
polish 'odc.'/'Odcinek'/'Sezon' markers used by shinden-like dumps.
Movies (300, 1917, 'Title - 2', 'Title - 1977') and generic folders
(Anime, Filmy, Downloads...) never match.

Adds unit tests for this naming and for metadata overrides.
